<title>FRANCE: Moulinex 96/97 H1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Moulinex 96/97 H1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		   loss     74  vs    loss   121</p>
<p>    Operating			    loss	9  vs    loss    99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional	 loss     50  vs    loss   168</p>
<p>    Exceptionals			 loss     29  vs    gain    52</p>
<p>    Financial expense			     41  vs		69</p>
<p>    Turnover				     3,352  vs	   3,268</p>
<p>NOTE - The company issued the results in a statement and said the financial expense was reduced by lower interest rates and that the operating result showed a narrower loss because of lower raw material prices and more favourable exchange rates.</p>
<p>The extraordinary charge primarily entails a provision for a legal expense.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
